OL,3,GNEWSA'My son survived crash because of 
OL,4,Arear-facing car seat'                  
OL,6,F"I believe my son's rear-facing seat   
OL,7,Fsaved his life," said mum Jenny        
OL,8,FEverson. Two-year-old Marlo was in an  
OL,9,Fextended rear-facing car seat when the 
OL,10,Ffamily was hit by a speeding driver who
OL,11,Flost control and crashed head-on into  
OL,12,Ftheir car on Sheffield Parkway in      
OL,13,FDecember 2023.                         
OL,15,FJenny and her mum, Marlo's grandma,    
OL,16,FAnne, suffered multiple injuries while 
OL,17,FMarlo escaped with some bruising and a 
OL,18,Fcut on his lip.                        
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
