OL,3,GNEWSA'My son survived crash because of 
OL,4,Arear-facing car seat'                  
OL,6,FJenny believes his car seat helped     
OL,7,Fprotect him from more serious injuries 
OL,8,Fand is calling for parents to be       
OL,9,Fadvised to use extended rear-facing    
OL,10,Fseats until children are at least four 
OL,11,Fyears old.                             
OL,13,F"It's impacted everyday life `         
OL,14,Fthankfully we've recovered quite well  
OL,15,Fnow but it was a long road, with       
OL,16,Flengthy recovery, with lots of         
OL,17,Frehabilitation, physiotherapy,         
OL,18,Fhydrotherapy, psychotherapy," she said.
